At this point, the owner of the airdrop contract is the NFT address.

After transferring the ownership to the nft contract, is impossible to call the allowDAOFund(), because is set with a onlyOwner modifier, and no function in the TraitForgeNft contract will call the allowDAOFund() in the airdrop contract. 
It's even impossible to change the ownership of the airdrop contract because the caller should be the nft contract and no function handles this scenario.



