As you can see above, only the specific forgingFee should be sent to the NukeFund contract and the forgerOwner, regardless of the amount of ETH (msg.value) being transmitted. If the forgingFee is changed for any reason before the transaction is executed, there might be leftover ETH in the contract 
As a result users suffer from loss of fund.

