## Impact
The forger could forge more than its forging potential for one more. For example, with `ForgerTokenId` with forge potential of `1`, first you can `listForForging`. Then after someone merge with you, you can `listForForging` again. And someone can merge with you again result in `forgingCount` of your `ForgerTokenId` has value of `2` although your potential is just `1`.

