Function `TraitForgeNft::startAirdrop` call function from other contract `Airdrop::startAirdrop`. Function `Airdrop::startAirdrop` has `onlyOwner` modifier which restrict this function to be called only by the owner of the contract. In this case the function is call by the `TraitForgeNft` contract, `TraitForgeNft` is not the owner, so the call will revert.

