# Vulnerability details

## Impact
According to the whitepaper, during the first 2 passes of entropy generation, Golden Trait, aka, entropy which equals to 999999 is scanned and checked. However, in reality, the check is faulty, and can still make golden trait appear, devauling the rarity of golden trait entities.

## Proof of Concept
Quoting the whitepaper:
> There is a certain entropy, “999999” which is referred to as “the Golden God”, since it has perfect parameters and will exceed all other entities if played correctly. The Golden God is scanned for and is kept out of the first 2 passes, but is deliberately set in the final pass (at some random point). The Golden God should be the most valuable entity. 

But what the code has done:

```solidity
